+{
+  "type": "feature",
+  "category": "``s3``",
+  "description": "Customize the S3 ``Expires`` timestamp. Operations with an ``Expires`` output member now add a synthetic ``ExpiresString`` member holding the raw header value, and ``Expires`` is deprecated in favor of it. If the ``Expires`` value cannot be parsed as a timestamp, the operation completes, ``Expires`` is omitted from the response, and a warning is logged instead of raising an error."
+}
